  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Revenue Administration and Revenue Policy - Guinea-Bissau</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the tax administration, Direco-geral de Contribuies e Impostos (DGCI), in streamlining and documenting audit procedures, providing training on use of procedures, and improving basic management practices. Additional activities for 2017 include implementing withholding and corporate tax return forms and accompanying instructions, developing a sales tax return form, and implementing the ministerial order on withholding of property tax.</narrative>
  </description>
